 man looking out the window from the driver's seat on a rainy night. There is a red lipstick printed on the car window with traces of rain.\nサイバーパンク風。 トーンは暗めで、リンクされている最初の画像に傾いています。\n特徴：狼の耳、赤い目、黒い髪。 雨の夜、車の窓から運転席から窓の外を眺めている男性の半身像を描いていただきたいのですが、車の窓には雨の跡がついた赤い口紅がプリントされています。\n\nhttps://twitter.com/Ekshe4Ek/status/1721622585782202512?t=4Z9HcscRk0Vqh3PjEdVKzw&s=19", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@koshomoti/works/14", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2136589, "client_id": 2522463, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0ba0a76b/uploads/origins/e52e028d-1fea-49ba-8bdd-c37711827a06?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=db599880b0b2af2cab221f729a5dff23", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0ba0a76b/uploads/origins/e52e028d-1fea-49ba-8bdd-c37711827a06?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=db599880b0b2af2cab221f729a5dff23, https://si.imgix.net/0ba0a76b/uploads/origins/e52e028d-1fea-49ba-8bdd-c37711827a06?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7702f4919f4956b5d4602acddfb26150 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0ba0a76b/uploads/origins/e52e028d-1fea-49ba-8bdd-c37711827a06?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ae73e5bc85f2fb01cf9f319a378d4dd0 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0ba0a76b/uploads/origins/e52e028d-1fea-49ba-8bdd-c37711827a06?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=71ee07448b8f2f67ce756113f2ef0644", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0ba0a76b/uploads/origins/e52e028d-1fea-49ba-8bdd-c37711827a06?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=71ee07448b8f2f67ce756113f2ef0644, https://si.imgix.net/0ba0a76b/uploads